{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026T90PpV3gdy1793077410.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>筲箕灣發生爆水管事件。今早（27日）10時左右，筲箕灣道潤民商業中心對開一個路面地盤突然發生爆水管事件。據現場街坊表示，懷疑有地盤工人在施工期間意外鑿穿水管。</p><p></p><p>網絡流傳的影片極具震撼力，片中所見，大量夾雜泥沙的黃泥水從地底瘋狂湧出，水柱高達數米，由於水勢猛</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-27-12h54m26s734.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Y1oSxMTmoU1793077384.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>烈，當時不少正在過路的市民見狀大驚，紛紛即時調頭避走。</p><p></p><p>事件隨即引起附近居民熱烈討論，不少街坊憂心忡忡，留言表示：「又整爆街喉，不知會不會又沒水。」更有受影響的街坊無奈坦言，家中的水供應已經即時中斷，擔心影響全日作息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:43:04.618115+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.468135+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:40.148689+00:00","content_hash":"022956d8ddab5a61966e0e6a338428a2d632d7a1ceeb434c323a757113fba9f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:43:04.618115+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}